editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/STATE_LEDGER.md:585:**Seln.** Shadow; Bronze. Unmarked. He fetched the bow, opened the jaws, carried Karis to the stone and called "Back". He has said "Compact" aloud once. He has given what he remembers of eight sheets and has refused to guess the file; nobody knows what such a file holds. He has struck Cael's second reason himself ("I should sooner have her told what may be done to her than be used to keep her ignorant") **without offering to be known to Oryn as a source**; the seal stands. **The case is on its strap, on him, shut.**
