editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:5:Read before the manuscript: `EDITION_BRIEF.md`; all of `OWNER-DECISIONS.md`, with special attention to #18, #23–#25, #33, #42 and #46–#51; Book 7's `BOOK_MAP.md`, all eight AFTER MOVEMENT blocks and binding coordinator rulings in `STATE_LEDGER.md`, `protected-patterns.txt`, and `COMPLETION-PLAN.md`; Book 6 ch59–60; Book 8's opening plan; and Book 6's whole-arc read as the report model. Then read `manuscript/chapter-01.md` through `chapter-60.md` in order, every word, keeping `state/completion/whole-arc-notes.md` during the read. Mechanical audits followed: calendar, deployments, money, board, sheets, injuries, geography, quotations, knowledge releases, protected text, repetition, formula metrics, and the required source probe. No manuscript file was modified and no git command was run.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:11:The calendar, deployment count, money, injuries, site geometry, names, knowledge limits, protected wording, Reader Standard and both book seams hold. Movements 3 and 7 earn their excess over the planning guide. The Hall adds a new opponent rule and a new cooperative solution rather than proving the Ring again (ch53:229–339; ch54:91–107, :191–323). The source-distance audit finds no surviving unprotected source-shaped passage. No line-level correction is warranted. The only recommended work is a controlled two-lane same-author texture pass: the book's hand/count/accounting motifs are appropriate, but its retrospective glosses, measured pauses and repeated evaluative looks make the surface more patterned than the events require.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:27:Shadow is used exactly twice, at the Ring and Stair (ch32:117–127; ch50:213–255). Both uses are outside hostile sight; Oryn sees neither and never learns Seln is the source (ch34:25–47; ch51:165–173). The closing inventory states the same sealed logic without expanding it (ch60:37).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:59:The book uses `[UNBOUND]` once, and only as a dating limit (ch42:269). `Compact` is spoken in the authorized stake discussion and later protected/book-ending contexts, not as early public knowledge (ch34:247–249; ch58:229; ch60:83). Oryn learns the fragment mechanism from Cael's telling, with sources identified by Path or protected description; no outsider tells her (ch38:3–47). Teague is neither read nor told; his wrist remains his information (ch56:153–205).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:141:No continuity, consent, knowledge-boundary, protected-text, Reader-Standard or source-distance defect justifies a line replacement. The remaining concerns are distributive texture problems and cannot be repaired honestly by isolated substitutions. Therefore there is no `old` string to list or uniqueness check to perform merely to fill the section.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/state/completion/whole-arc-read.md:149:## 11. Close to source
