editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/manuscript/chapter-58.md:17:She turned to Lira, and held out her two hands, and Lira gave her the sling without a word. The wool came down. The healer's fingers went round the forearm, overlapping, and she took the short reading, to ten.

