+6. First six: `Karis held a pencil on the`  
+   Last six: `"Read it before you say so."`  
+   Listening notes: Cael's six italic paragraphs are one continuous log entry, deployment one. `quiet ground` remains lower-case here and is documented as the carter's wife's term. Pike, Cael and Lira are distinct at the closing tack. Clean.
+
