+
+### Creatures, Paths and working terms
+
+| Term | Say / handle |
+|---|---|
+| stillhound | STILL-hound; one compound | the grey road-hunting animal |
+| shale-back | SHAYL-back; one compound | the high-country animal named by Pike |
