+2. First six: `Brom came up out of the`  
+   Last six: `"Go on, then," said Brom.`  
+   Listening notes: Four-person tactical council is well tagged. Lira, Brom and Karis each contribute role-specific corrections to Cael’s plan. `Wind` is the Path. Clean.
+3. First six: `He went down the spine of`  
+   Last six: `were on the count," he said.`  
+   Listening notes: Cael’s inward landing count `*One*` is thought. After the action, `Five` is Lira’s count, Karis owns the next line, and Seln’s regret is tagged; no fight-order ambiguity. Clean.
