+4. First six: `The carter was back on the`  
+   Last six: `I don't know what it is."`  
+   Listening notes: Cael reads Pike’s protected bark line aloud; Lira, Brom, Karis and Seln answers are tagged. The two italic closing entries are Cael’s log, deployment one. `bowman’s word` is BOH. Clean.
+5. First six: `Karis had been awake since four`  
+   Last six: `put no question to him either.`  
